  "contentHtml": "<p>1. 좋아서 하는 밴드 &lt;천체사진&gt;</p><p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/JIu78ApzJm0\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/JIu78ApzJm0</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JIu78ApzJm0\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"868\" data-video-height=\"488\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bQYtJa/hyL0Q97nbU/CTyNjLa70T7aPmgf88RiJ1/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"868\" data-video-origin-height=\"488\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/JIu78ApzJm0\" width=\"868\" height=\"488\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>2. 적재 &lt;별 보러 가자&gt;</p><p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/Mz031oU0Xfw\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/Mz031oU0Xfw</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mz031oU0Xfw\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"868\" data-video-height=\"488\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/qZt8F/hyL0Y8aYpx/QEOKiaKkOklUAhyy16ppAk/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"868\" data-video-origin-height=\"488\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Mz031oU0Xfw\" width=\"868\" height=\"488\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>3. 비틀즈 &lt;Lucy In The Sky With Diamonds&gt;</p><p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/O4hTUPFBaaQ\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/O4hTUPFBaaQ</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=O4hTUPFBaaQ\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"854\" data-video-height=\"480\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/lNzsJ/hyLZWYqh63/SDnKxWIaO3nxT9wODPyIdk/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"854\" data-video-origin-height=\"480\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/O4hTUPFBaaQ\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>- 1967에 발매된 노래.</p><p>- 존 레논 아들 친구 이름이 &#39;루시&#39;</p><p>- 1974년 최초로 발굴된 오스트랄로피테쿠스의 이름을 이 노래 듣다가 &#39;루시&#39;로 붙임.(아프리카 에티오피아에서)</p><p><a href=\"https://namu.wiki/w/Lucy%20in%20the%20Sky%20with%20Diamonds\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://namu.wiki/w/Lucy%20in%20the%20Sky%20with%20Diamonds</a></p><p>- 2004 다이아몬드 별 &#39;루시&#39; <a href=\"https://www.hankookilbo.com/News/Read/201902111233099416\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.hankookilbo.com/News/Read/201902111233099416</a></p><p>- 2021년 10월 16일(그제!) 발사된 소행성 탐사선 이름도 &#39;루시&#39; <a href=\"https://www.yna.co.kr/view/AKR20211016017051009?input=1195m\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.yna.co.kr/view/AKR20211016017051009?input=1195m</a>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"목성 주변 소행성 탐사선 '루시', 12년 대장정 올랐다(종합) | 연합뉴스\" data-og-description=\"(서울=연합뉴스) 엄남석 기자 = 미국 항공우주국(NASA)의 소행성 탐사선 '루시'(Lucy)가 16일(이하 한국시간) 모두 8개의 소행성을 ...\" data-og-host=\"www.yna.co.kr\" data-og-source-url=\"https://www.yna.co.kr/view/AKR20211016017051009?input=1195m\" data-og-url=\"https://www.yna.co.kr/view/AKR20211016017051009\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/rLokI/hyL0XnTyhi/75a8VKnnxKOMCe50O39Qfk/img.jpg?width=500&amp;height=333&amp